        DayKey(2026-10-22)  DayKey(2026-10-21) …    LongKey(episodes/patterns/sent/audit)
        (wrapped by KEK,     stored in keys.db)
           │        │
           ▼        ▼
   SQLCipher key   per-file DEK = HKDF(DayKey, frame_id)

